{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:06 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:06 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:06 2026-11-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"校巴與貨車相撞，男學童送院治理。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/58046de8128ebde9e76f1f1e57c481ef/2026-11/1_4_11.jpeg\"/><p>今日（18日）早上7時45分，一部載有英華小學學童的校巴與一部運菜貨車先後沿連翔道行駛，當駛至南昌站對開時，校巴疑因應路面情況收慢，惟尾隨貨車司機報稱地面有餿水，收掣不及，撞向校巴車尾。校巴司機及車上一名男學童輕傷，貨車司機則無恙，在場協助調查，警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"貨車司機在場協助調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d9c3980ea9db7917a45c38d4ecb7c7e2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_38_4_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"被撞校巴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f9c677d6e8fb3c9f3cd402dae23dd1be/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_38_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb44e676be3c9982a04952ab6af27103/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"校巴車尾被撞毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6576fbe3c2f4acaf1175273027996659/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車收掣不及撞校巴。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23c9022dd4ec94a44943482b73a71b4b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_37_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e1a6f0c92f53d0e019d617a0b4de5faf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"校巴車尾損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/38a024ceb4bf186fba35295b5cde356f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_53_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"校巴司機送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/075a3c32d558083aef347de81c0bf302/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_08_42_32.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:26:04.099165+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:06:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:19:37.907808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-